description.narrative:
The new strategic plan 2023-2027 includes four major objectives defined as "purposes":

1. To promote measures of prevention, protection, accountability and redress; 

2. Promote a national legislative, policy and institutional framework upholding human rights, in conjunction with sustainable development goals (SDGs); 

3. Promote and consolidate the culture of human rights; 

4. Promote ICHR's institutional development and sustainability.
